erved German foods and beer in its grand hall for 91 years. Closing briefly from June until November 2014, the restaurant was purchased from longtime owner Rudi Scherff by Peter Picknelly of Peter Pan Bus Lines and Andy Yee, of the former Hu Ke Lau restaurant, in an agreement making them general partners, with Scherff remaining \"the face of Student Prince\". In 2008, Gourmet listed it among \"20 Legendary American Restaurants\", among the company of Galatoire's, Locke-Ober, and the Grand Central Oyster Bar & Restaurant."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-the-student-prince-restaurant"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Student_Prince_(restaurant)"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["German cuisine","cuisine/german-cuisine"],["Thuringian cuisine","cuisine/german-cuisine-thuringia"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Quick German Recipes","ref":"site/quick-german-recipes-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"quick-german-recipes.com","note":"Long-running site by German-born cook Gerhild Fulson (Oma) with traditional German home recipes.","url":"https://www.quick-german-recipes.com/about-me.html","suggested":true},{"name":"Dirndl Kitchen","ref":"site/dirndlkitchen-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"dirndlkitchen.com","note":"Blog of German and Bavarian recipes, from main dishes to holiday baking.","url":"https://dirndlkitchen.com","suggested":true},{"name":"Quick German Recipes","ref":"site/quick-german-recipes-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"quick-german-recipes.com","note":"Thuringia page on German-born cook Gerhild Fulson's long-running German recipe site.","url":"https://www.quick-german-recipes.com/thuringia.html","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from German cuisine","links":[["Baumkuchen","dish/baumkuchen"],["Berlin Inn","dish/berlin-inn"],["Bockwurst","dish/bockwurst"],["Buchteln","dish/buchteln"],["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-roll"],["Chrain","dish/chrain"],["Dampfnudel","di